From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Port AZH4 SoftAP capability fallbacks

Reason: product-tail-after-ape.txt fails old MOBILEAP_11AX diffs; product-tail-softap.txt fails the old country fallback diff, and independent old power/sharing-lite patch preflights also fail. AZH4 changes registers, driver-query visibility, Binder identity handling and SQE command layout. Route only AX case1 to the existing public driver query; preserve other feature cases. On missing/NA HAL country data, call the existing region query while preserving permissions, valid HAL results and Binder restore on success/exception. Select power support from the driver string, disable the legacy-incompatible power worker initializer and split only its SQE command from the shared supported branch. Enable sharing-lite conditionally on sharing, preserving carrier/model exclusions. Update diagnostic SPF flags only for the selected target differences.
Files: unica/patches/product_feature/customize.sh; unica/patches/product_feature/wifi/a376b_softap.py.
Verification: exact donor method/region hashes, public query signature, enum/dispatch validation; country/power/sharing-lite fixtures and no-partial-write rejection PASS; independent Apktool jar assembly PASS. Actual recipe remainder passes. Clean full build/compiled gates and native Wi-Fi/hotspot runtime remain required. Revert0052; no scan-UI, RF, kernel or ADB-rule change.

